[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3]

; A three-layer 2.6m arrival-curb planting module. Its local -X edge faces the
; curb: pointed border rosettes, a clustered flower drift, then fine-pinnaed
; fern outer fill. The low groundcover is split and offset so repetition joins
; into a loose bed instead of making one round green collar per module.

